  "details": "Reproduction:\n\n1. Join a Terrors of Nowhere instance with other people\n\n2. Let a round start without joining the round\n\n3. Stand on the spectator platform in the back\n\n4. If it was working correctly, a spectator screen would show up, allowing you to spectate individual players and the Terror. As it is now, the screen does not even enable when you stand on the platform.\n\n(Pictures for comparison)",
